      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "def dup(arr):\n    size = len(arr)\n    duplicate = []\n    for i in range(size):\n        for j in range(i+1,size):\n            if arr[i] == arr[j] and arr[i] not in duplicate:\n                duplicate.append(arr[i])\n    return duplicate\n\narr = [1,2,4,3,4,5,2]\nprint(dup(arr))",
